    "palette": "All four theme variants generate opaque named native color assets; numeric palette values remain unchanged.",
    "implemented": "Shared scalable reading (20), support (18), metadata (17), section (24), observation (28) and action (20) roles; 16-point buttons, 20-point cards/camera, 12-point notices; 64/56-point primary/secondary minimum heights.",
